Here is the continuation and completion of the IntarsiaML architecture plan, picking up from the `mermaid` diagram and proceeding through the remaining sections of the v0.2 specification.

---

```mermaid
  end
  subgraph Core["Engine core (crate: intarsia-core)"]
    CFG["Config: Model recipe, KV cache, Quant map"]
    SCHED["Scheduler: Pre-fill, Decode, Prefetch"]
    KV["KV Manager: Paged, Swap, Async"]
    DISPATCH["Dispatcher: Op routing, Kernel selection"]
  end
  subgraph Kernels["Kernel Packs (Crate: intarsia-kernels)"]
    TF["TensorFold (MIT): CUDA/HIP GEMM, MoE, FlashAttn"]
    RAD["Radiance (Apache-2.0): HIP/RDMA optimized, NVFP4"]
    PORT["Portable: Norm, Rope, Sampling, Elementwise"]
  end
  subgraph Utils["Offline Tools (Python/uv)"]
    GOLD["Golden Ref: HF Transformers"]
    CONV["Converters: GGUF, Safetensors"]
    BENCH["Benchmarks: Latency,
